{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your High School days in the town of Agefield. It\u2019s the early 2000s and you have three months left at school. So REBEL with your friends, win over your dream girl and ROCK the school! <br> <br><strong>COMPLEX TIME AND SCHOOL SYSTEM </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Attend Agefield High School as new student Sam. Help your new friends, Kale and Axel, pull off their \u201cRock the School\u201d plan and leave your mark as a legend! But... there's a time and school system which means you have to be in class until the afternoon on weekdays! But you know what? Cool kids skip class and do whatever they want.     <br>     <br><strong>GET BACK TO THE EARLY 2000s </strong>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Besides going to class and playing main missions, the small open world of Agefield is free to explore! Featuring the Agefield high school campus, two neighborhoods, the town center and the countryside. Earn some pocket money by getting good grades or skip class and earn cash by doing side missions. You can buy things like clothes, bikes and more. But keep an eye out for teachers and the cops if you break the law!    <br>      <br><strong>THE 'ROCK THE SCHOOL' PLAN </strong>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when Sam was about to graduate from high school, his parents decided to move to a small town called Agefield. On Sam\u2019s first day at Agefield High, he meets Kale. Kale has a plan to ROCK the last few months at school because he wants to leave his mark as a LEGEND. He enlisted the help of Axel, a self proclaimed Rockstar, now it\u2019s time to execute the plan. But they need one more to be onboard. Kale believes Sam is exactly the right person for the job.        <br>So you in, dude?\u00a0<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>     <br>- A story about teenagers with a total gameplay duration of 8-10h   <br>- Time &amp; School System with school attendance   <br>- Small Open-World featuring the school campus, neighborhoods, town center, countryside   <br>- 30 Main Missions with two different endings   <br>- 15 Side Missions/Activitys<br>- 5 Different lesson types featuring English, Math, Geography, German, Music   <br>- Shops to buy bikes, clothes, hairstyles, tattoos, accessories, dirty magazines, and more  <br>     <br><strong>ADD THE GAME NOW TO YOUR WISHLIST</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562580?t=1756400450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/1e9c29f247ef892737044aced8fe7463440c0a43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756400450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/060d0712a95974d30ad06a8d453a1073c0f2c1da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756400450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/060d0712a95974d30ad06a8d453a1073c0f2c1da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756400450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"fights without blood, dark humor, mention of suicide, alcohol consumption, sexual innuendos, nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your High School days in the town of Agefield. It\u2019s the early 2000s and you have three months left at school. So REBEL with your friends, win over your dream girl and ROCK the school! <br> <br><strong>COMPLEX TIME AND SCHOOL SYSTEM </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/43ed3d0de130a3f8de172419d4f45002.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Attend Agefield High School as new student Sam. Help your new friends, Kale and Axel, pull off their \u201cRock the School\u201d plan and leave your mark as a legend! But... there's a time and school system which means you have to be in class until the afternoon on weekdays! But you know what? Cool kids skip class and do whatever they want.     <br>     <br><strong>GET BACK TO THE EARLY 2000s </strong>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/bd7fa419c584627bf6cd0fa529c690c4.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Besides going to class and playing main missions, the small open world of Agefield is free to explore! Featuring the Agefield high school campus, two neighborhoods, the town center and the countryside. Earn some pocket money by getting good grades or skip class and earn cash by doing side missions. You can buy things like clothes, bikes and more. But keep an eye out for teachers and the cops if you break the law!    <br>      <br><strong>THE 'ROCK THE SCHOOL' PLAN </strong>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.poster.avif?t=1756400450\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.webm?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/extras/a54225b27f37ece170d1f661de59be28.mp4?t=1756400450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when Sam was about to graduate from high school, his parents decided to move to a small town called Agefield. On Sam\u2019s first day at Agefield High, he meets Kale. Kale has a plan to ROCK the last few months at school because he wants to leave his mark as a LEGEND. He enlisted the help of Axel, a self proclaimed Rockstar, now it\u2019s time to execute the plan. But they need one more to be onboard. Kale believes Sam is exactly the right person for the job.        <br>So you in, dude?\u00a0<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>     <br>- A story about teenagers with a total gameplay duration of 8-10h   <br>- Time &amp; School System with school attendance   <br>- Small Open-World featuring the school campus, neighborhoods, town center, countryside   <br>- 30 Main Missions with two different endings   <br>- 15 Side Missions/Activitys<br>- 5 Different lesson types featuring English, Math, Geography, German, Music   <br>- Shops to buy bikes, clothes, hairstyles, tattoos, accessories, dirty magazines, and more  <br>     <br><strong>ADD THE GAME NOW TO YOUR WISHLIST</strong></p>","developers":["Refugium Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562580/3de7217500e647969adf058898670fa28abf84d6/header.jpg?t=1756400450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/356